                "textId": "Performance_1999990047_2534707108_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A想象}云果的旋律，弹出来、很动听，\n和云果一起经历的事，都很悦耳。\n以后，也会是颗、好看珍珠。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
